WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read the invoice and seller orders
One invoice can contain separate seller orders. Read each order and
payment state rather than treating the invoice as one parcel.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Follow the parcel
Use the tracking timeline for the relevant order. A delivery estimate is
different from a recorded delivery event.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check return progress
Eligibility and next actions depend on the purchase and store rules.
Approval, receipt, inspection and refund are separate stages.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Read help or open a ticket
Choose a question in Help centre. If you still need help, sign in and
open a ticket with the relevant invoice or order number.

